  "tips": "**Memberi saran tanpa terdengar memerintah**\n\n- *I think ...* = Menurut saya ... → *I think this name is too long.*\n- *Maybe we should ...* = Mungkin sebaiknya kita ... → *Maybe we should add a test.*\n- *It is better to ...* = Lebih baik ... → *It is better to use a short name.*\n\nSetelah **should**, langsung kata kerja bentuk dasar, **tanpa to**:\n*We should to add a test* ✗ → *We should add a test* ✓\n\nSetelah **better to**, juga bentuk dasar: *better to use*.\n\nKata **we** (kita) terdengar lebih ramah daripada **you**. *I think* di sini bukan \"saya sedang berpikir\", tapi \"menurut saya\".\n\n**suggestion** = saran. *I have a suggestion.* = Saya punya saran.",
